const char *const text_pages[] = {
"The bells of the Undertown have gone quiet.",
"Without them the city forgets itself, one street at a\ntime.",
"In a dusty loft, a small warden in a kite-shaped\nmask opens its eyes. Its name is Menuel.",
"Oh! You are awake, Menuel. Good. I am too old to\nclimb.",
"Four bells keep this place alive. Something has\nstolen their voices.",
"Take your axe. Wake the bells. Start in the Salt\nMines, up the ledges and to the right.",
"The lanterns still burn. Rest by one and it will\nremember you.",
"Press Up to use it. Pause with Start to see your\nmap on the lower screen.",
"I heard it! A bell! Faint, but true. Keep going, little\nwarden.",
"Mind your head. The Foreman still works his shift,\nand he does not know he is dead.",
"His pit lies across the broken span. No one jumps\nthat far.",
"But there is a shrine left of here. The old ones left\na gift for fast feet.",
"The span is up the shaft and to the right. Press R\nin the air to rush.",
"Name? Date of drowning? No? Then I cannot help\nyou. Sorry. Habit.",
"The belfry flooded years ago. The rope men never\nlet go of their ropes.",
"Below the rope walk there is a hook, for those\nwho must cross the bells.",
"Anchor rings hold a hook. Press L near one. File\nthat under useful.",
"Hah. That axe is dull and you swing it like a\nbroom.",
"Take what lies on my anvil. Hold Down and strike\nwhile falling.",
"Cracked floors will give way. My two brothers are\nbelow. They share one apron.",
"There is a cracked floor in the scrap tower. Fall\nhard and strike.",
"Shh. Up here we keep the quiet. It is all that is left.",
"The Ringer took the voices so that nothing would\nhurt any more.",
"It meant well. That is the worst of it. Take the\ncloak. The wind will lift you twice.",
"Jump again in the air. The last bell hangs above\nthe high shelf.",
"A: jump. B: axe. Hold A to jump higher.",
"Each hit fills your echo. Hold X on solid ground to\nturn echo into health.",
"Down: drop through a ledge. Start: pause and\nmap.",
"Shift log, day 9,114. The bell has stopped. Work\ncontinues.",
"The water rose without a sound. Nothing here\nmakes a sound now.",
"We cast the last bell here. We gave it no tongue. It\nwas told to wait.",
"When all is ringing, who will listen? When all is\nquiet, who will hurt?",
"You found the Rush. Press R to dart forward, on\nthe ground or in the air.",
"You found the Hook. Press L near an anchor ring,\nor tap a ring on the lower screen.",
"You found the Cleave. Hold Down and press B in\nthe air to crash down and break cracked floors.",
"You found the Cloak of Wind. Press A in the air to\njump again.",
"A bell shard. It hums in your hands. Maximum\nhealth up.",
"A whetstone. The axe bites twice as deep.",
"Shift... not... over.",
"The rope... must not... slacken.",
"Who comes? A customer! No, brother. A thief!\nThen we melt it.",
"The Anvil stands alone. It has waited a long time\nto be struck.",
"Little one. Put it down. Listen. Isn't the quiet kind?",
"Somewhere far above, the first bell begins to ring.",
"The rope goes slack. The second bell answers the\nfirst.",
"The brothers fall quiet, and for once they agree.\nThe way on is open.",
"The Anvil splits. The third bell sounds through the\niron. The way up is open.",
"The Ringer lays down its hands. The last bell\nhangs in front of you, silent.",
"Menuel takes the axe and strikes the bell itself.",
"The note rolls down the mountain, through iron\nand water and salt.",
"All across the Undertown, people remember their\nnames.",
"The little warden sits down and listens for a\nwhile.",
};
